.vscode/
*~

# Ignore benchmark/ because it can be too large
benchmark/

# The upstream repository tracks source files below these otherwise ignored
# output directories.  Keep the source needed by OpenTimer's unconditional
# CMake example and unit-test targets while continuing to ignore executables
# and runtime data generated there.
!example/
!example/*/
!example/*/*.cpp
!unittest/
!unittest/*.cpp
!unittest/doctest.h
